window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>This 3-in-1 bundle of spicy space operas collects books seven through nine of the Xiveri Mates saga: <i>Taken by the Pikosa Warlord, Taken to Evernor, and Taken to Sky</i><b><i>.</i></b></p> <p><b><i>Taken by the Pikosa Warlord</i></b></p> <p>Welcome back to Earth—what's left of it, that is, after an attack by a dark and gritty barbarian warlord. He has no idea I can speak his language, or that I know he calls me <i>mine.</i></p> <p><b><i>Taken to Evernor</i></b></p> <p>The alien gladiator is going to win…and I'm the prize. But the more time I spend with him, the more I think he's my ticket off of this planet.</p> <p><b><i>Taken to Sky</i></b></p> <p>The Quadrant's most renowned assassin has been hunting me for rotations. Now, it’s time to return the favor. I'm going to crack through his armored flesh if it kills me.</p>"; 
